    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "All recorded numerical accuracies match their cited tables. These are method-performance results, not evidence for V1–V8. Figure 3 reports training cross-entropy alongside validation accuracy, so the blanket statement that no training performance is reported is too strong; these curves still do not supply V7's required measure or train–test error-gap ranking. Appendix A.2 uses unit-norm perturbation directions without weight-magnitude scaling. Table 3 reports Flowers high-norm accuracy as 75.36%, whereas Tables 1 and 4 report 75.56%; retain each table's value and flag the source inconsistency. The abstract mentions language-modeling benchmarks, but the supplied experiments report only image-classification and fine-tuning results."
  },
